{
  "source": "One learner's path through a LearnDash course, as the companion WordPress plugin prints it on each page in window.ddRumLearnDash (the shape is in src/types.ts). Not captured from a live LearnDash site: built to that contract, to be replaced with captures once the companion plugin ships. A `page` fixture is a page load, which starts a fresh plugin; `click` is a click on the quiz's start button. The learner's email and display name are included on purpose, to prove they are never sent.",
